 values('20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','the-bile-of-the-river','The Bile of the River','An African Saga','A different way into the past. Edmund’s historical fiction explores African history through the art of storytelling.',array['The Bile of the River brings another literary perspective to Edmund Spencer Katso’s work: historical fiction.','Alongside the research and personal memory of the 4Daniel books, this standalone African saga explores history through fiction.'],'Historical fiction',null,null,'/images/the-bile-of-the-river.jpg',3,'navy',array['Historical fiction','African narratives','Storytelling'],'https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/253569061-an-african-saga',true,'published',true) on conflict(slug) do nothing;
